        "accordion_EE6Ypn": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>Stay Cool, Stay Supported:</strong> The Sihoo M59AS combines a breathable mesh design with ergonomic features, ensuring comfort and support all day long.</p><p><strong>Breathable Mesh Design:</strong> The full mesh construction promotes airflow, keeping you cool and comfortable throughout long hours of sitting.</p><p><strong>Dual-Section Backrest:</strong> Designed to contour to your spine, this backrest provides tailored support and maintains a natural \"S\" shape for optimal back comfort.</p><p><strong>3D Adjustable Flip-Up Armrests:</strong> Adjust the armrests in three directions—up and down, back and forth, and rotating—for customizable arm and shoulder support, while also offering space-saving flexibility.</p><p><strong>Dynamic Lumbar Support:</strong> Adjusts seamlessly to your lower back's natural curvature, offering personalized comfort whether you're sitting still or moving.</p><p><strong>Double-Jointed Headrest:</strong> The headrest adjusts in height and rotates, providing precise neck support and aligning with your natural posture.</p><p><strong>Saddle-Shaped Seat Cushion:</strong> Expertly distributes pressure across your hips and thighs for added comfort, preventing fatigue during long work sessions.</p><p><strong>Recline and Relax:</strong> Recline up to 126° for a comfortable break. The recline function allows you to lean back, relax, and recharge effortlessly.</p><p><strong>Integrated Coat Hanger:</strong> Thoughtfully designed for added convenience, allowing you to store your coat or bag within easy reach and keep them wrinkle-free.</p><p><strong>Effortless Adjustments:</strong> Easily modify seat height and recline angle for a personalized, ergonomic seating experience with simple controls.</p><p><strong>Built to Last:</strong> Crafted with premium materials, including high-quality mesh and durable components, ensuring long-lasting comfort and reliability.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
